OL,3,GNEWSARace Across the World star dies
OL,4,Ayear after son
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Race Across the World
OL,7,Fcontestant has died, a year after her
OL,8,Fson and co-star's death in a car crash.
OL,10,FJo Gardiner, 61, died "following a long
OL,11,Fand courageous battle with cancer", her
OL,12,Ffamily said.
OL,14,FGardiner, a physiotherapist from
OL,15,FManchester, travelled across South
OL,16,FAmerica with her son Sam in the second
OL,17,Fseries of the BBC show, which aired in
OL,18,F2020.
OL,20,FHer family said she was "one of a kind"
OL,21,Fwho "lived fully, fiercely and never
OL,22,Fdid anything by halves".
